[node name="DoorEntrance" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Apartment entrance door: steel security frame and 65 mm leaf (0.84 x 2.06 m) for a 0.90 x 2.10 m opening in a 0.20 m wall. Origin = bottom center of the opening on the wall's center plane; +Z = apartment side, the leaf opens toward it (0..100 degrees), hinge on the -X jamb. Levers at 1.1 m on both faces, deadbolt thumb-turn and smart-lock LED (material door_entrance_lock_led) on the apartment face, unit plate 4417 outside. Heavy: it swings on less and the latch catches it within 3 degrees. Built by blender/props/door_entrance/ (D-026)."

